\item date: 01/06/90\ \ \ \ \ author:Petra de Wit
replaced specific pattern(s) by set of OPEN verbpatterns
\item date: 11/02/91\ \ \ \ \ author:Petra de Wit
altered COMP to give the resultative PP a predrel when it is no longer a PROP, 
analogous to the resultative ADJP which also gets a predrel.
\end{enumerate}
